H26.222, H26.223, H26.211, H26.212, H26.213, E08.36, E09.36, or H28 note that coding guidelines require that the ICD-10 code for the underlying condition must appear and be coded first on the claim. For ICD 10 code E13.36 an additional code to identify control is required. For ICD-10 codes H26.31, H26.32, H26.33 and H26.8, coding guidelines require that the causative agent be identified on the claim.","2":"For CPT codes 66982 and 66987 in addition to reporting one of the ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes in Group 1, listed above, the appropriate ICD-10-CM code(s) from the ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes in Group 2, listed below, must be reported. If reporting CPT code 66982 or 66987 with ICD-10 CM codes H25.21, H25.22, H25.23, or H25.89, a diagnosis code from Group 2 is not required."},"noncovered":{}}}]